    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44e311ab36b7da82728e7adc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小时候的她，被橡树赛马娘奔跑时的话语\n所感动。从那以后，便有了想要将自己的\n足迹与他人相连的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5444759e1385a87861f8ceda1b910020428b2f9b05c91151245bcb282e73b026",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109400.json",
      "json_path": [
