    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5663e665148d4d7a46a51f4c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2afc88aa7188c5f55f74a1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园里，也有后冠赛马娘前辈。\n莱茵力量总是两眼放光地盯着这些\n她所憧憬的背影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81a9cd1bbcc1a280d7cf784d39dacd125476b79b320aa4fc83e25c83e4b861bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109400.json",
      "json_path": [
