    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0076dfd0504b176555767cf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量到了『秋华赏』现场观战。\n在见到东商变革的胜利后，\n感受到了后冠赛马娘的可能性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfaa38b6745b7958814af4c972b364c006c004eb8e068f3b31f4d2bae9c7e9da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45606fbefedb078096bdb3a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c7af5953df2e9a03bcdce17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革之前在记者会上说过。\n要证明后冠赛马娘的强大。\n在这场比赛中，我们见识到了她的强大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a36719c8a42f4498425d7d178776242ff70935dc3578fff3c6222d5a248f74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109401.json",
      "json_path": [
