    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8a8d9636a5084dad8ad278d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量被同期的空中救主拜托了\n一起并跑。距离是1600m和2000m。",
